          {
            "text": "<p><strong>You must check-in at the campground kiosk upon arrival</strong>. After-hours arrivals must sign-in and return to the kiosk to complete check-in the following morning or your reservation may be cancelled.</p>",
            "type": "warning"
          },
          {
            "text": "<p><strong>Bears and other wildlife live here! Food and toiletries must be properly stored 24 hours/day.  </strong></p><ul><li><p>Food storage lockers are provided in all campsites (35 inches deep x 43 inches wide x 28 inches high). </p></li><li><p>Absolutely no food stored in vehicles. </p></li><li><p>Dispose of garbage immediately in bear-proof dumpsters.</p></li></ul>",
            "type": "warning"
          },
          {
            "text": "<p>There are no electric, water or sewer hook-ups available at individual campsites. A free dump station is located on-site along with potable water.</p>\n",
