          },
          {
            "text": "<p><strong>Your camping reservation does NOT get you into Yosemite for free.</strong> You must pay an additional fee per vehicle at the park entrance or <a href=\"https://www.recreation.gov/sitepass/74296\" rel=\"nofollow\">buy a pass ahead of time on recreation.gov.</a></p>",
